rule commission_review v1
description "Sorts an order by its commission: a tenth of the amount, and a fixed part. The range of the commission was written wide, and the last row asks for more than the inputs can make"

enum band = small | usual | large

inputs
  amount : money[GBP]  range >=1GBP <=100GBP
  fixed  : money[GBP]  range >=0GBP <=5GBP

outputs
  review : band

derive commission : money[GBP] = amount * 10% + fixed  range >=0GBP <=100GBP

table review_of
policy unique
| commission    | -> review : band |
| <=1GBP        | small            |
| >1GBP <=15GBP | usual            |
| >15GBP        | large            |
